{"name":"Pinque","hex":"#eca2ad","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"SoundCloud","blocks":[{"text":"SoundCloud is a German audio streaming service owned and operated by SoundCloud Global Limited & Co. KG. The service allows its users to upload, promote, and share audio. Founded in 2007 by Alexander Ljung and Eric Wahlforss, SoundCloud is one of the largest music streaming services in the world and is available in 190 countries and territories. The service has upwards of 76 million active monthly users and over 200 million audio tracks as of November 2021."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/7f/SoundCloud_Homepage.png/330px-SoundCloud_Homepage.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SoundCloud"},{"title":"Austroblechnum penna-marina","blocks":[{"text":"Austroblechnum penna-marina, synonym Blechnum penna-marina, known as Antarctic hard-fern, Little Hard Fern, Alpine Hard Fern, alpine water fern and pinque, is a species of fern in the family Blechnaceae. It is a widely distributed fern species in the southern hemisphere, with a natural range including New Zealand, Australia, and South America."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Blechnum_penna-marina_2.jpg/330px-Blechnum_penna-marina_2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Austroblechnum_penna-marina"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Eric_Wahlforss.jpg/500px-Eric_Wahlforss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Eric_Wahlforss.jpg/1280px-Eric_Wahlforss.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Eric_Wahlforss.jpg/500px-Eric_Wahlforss.jpg?utm_source=en.